silm:instances_papers_09_minimal_category_theory_sections_02_mittens_anchor_concrete_anchor_10_Animal#animal silm:hasLongDescription "The Animal is the supraclass node Animal at the top of the lineage chain. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Animal', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
